    <informations>Shelly Dimmer 2 — mounting plate, back view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: SW1 SW2 L L L N O.
Back view: the terminal order is mirrored against the front label face.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-dimmer-2
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_e3c4d696ea7778d143e8701b909dad76af6cdca513284b2a00d51ace9af13ae2/image-20220920-071316.png?cb=576a3aa0b4bd14e60ae94c3a3179e1f1
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_c3f3d87da8d4fe38e245205a5019d3c272e4dc8743b784b3a460c74c8cbdaa51/Shelly%20Dimmer%202%20multilingual%20printed%20user%20and%20safety%20guide.pdf?cb=3d43ae1218d834a9a9ff01e2c215354f

Notes:
- Terminal order from the official multilingual printed user and safety guide diagrams; three distinct L screws.

Open points:
- Legacy KB lists Size 42mm x 36mm x 14mm without axis labels. W=42/H=36 is the conventional product-view interpretation.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
